  "$comment":"Future real-data reports require a separately reviewed contract; this schema cannot unlock them. Missing/unmeasured rates and deltas are null. Match-rate denominator is the union of stable comparison keys, not only paired records. Delta matchedCount is reported separately; missing records never count as zero deltas. ENTRY stable ids must be session/symbol/First ENTER identity, independent of observed timestamp."
